# Built-in lesson. Text fields are bilingual "English|Chinese" (format: src/song/Song.h).
title: Jasmine Flower (Simplified)|茉莉花 (简化版)
artist: Jiangsu Folk Song|江苏民歌
bpm: 72
time: 2/4
level: 2
desc: A Chinese folk song with a pentatonic melody (key of G). The rhythm is simplified for beginners, and only strings 1, 2 and 3 are used. In English the lyrics are shown in pinyin.|中国民歌, 五声音阶旋律 (1=G). 节奏做了简化, 方便初学. 只用 1、2、3 弦.
desc: Tip: ring finger on string 1 fret 3 (high G); keep the melody smooth and get your finger ready before each change.|小贴士: 1弦3品 (高音 G) 用无名指; 旋律要连贯, 换音时手指提前准备.
